# Direct triangle-composition composition.
# Run: cargo run --release -- -strict -lang en -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_strategy/absolute_sum_triangle.lit
# Historical explicit proof:
# claim:
#     ? forall x,y,z R:
#         abs((x+y)+z)<=(abs(x)+abs(y))+abs(z)
#     abs(x+y)<=abs(x)+abs(y)
#     abs((x+y)+z)<=abs(x+y)+abs(z)<=(abs(x)+abs(y))+abs(z)
#     abs((x+y)+z)<=(abs(x)+abs(y))+abs(z)
# Boundary: all original domains and premises are required.
forall x,y,z R:
    abs((x+y)+z)<=(abs(x)+abs(y))+abs(z)
